# Public build settings for `npm run build` (the Cloudflare production and preview builds).
# Only public values belong here: this file is committed. Secrets go in Cloudflare as Pages secrets.

# Cloudflare Turnstile site key for asiatic-engineering.pages.dev (and its preview subdomains).
# Public by design: it is sent to every visitor's browser. The matching TURNSTILE_SECRET is a
# Pages secret in both the Production and Preview environments.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAGGP_NHD3TCgR6EX
